---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { formatDate, getPosts, postUrl } from '../../lib/posts';
import '../../styles/content.css';

const posts = await getPosts();
---

<BaseLayout title="글" description="공부하며 쓴 글들">
  <article>
    <header class="page-header">
      <h1>글</h1>
    </header>

    <ol class="post-list large">
      {posts.map((post) => (
        <li>
          <a class="post-list-entry" href={postUrl(post)}>
            <span>{post.data.title}</span>
            {post.data.tags.length > 0 && <span class="post-list-tags">{post.data.tags.join(' · ')}</span>}
          </a>
          <time datetime={post.data.date.toISOString()}>{formatDate(post.data.date)}</time>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ol>

    <div class="content">
      <h2>발표·교육 자료</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>지구과학II 별빛너머 모의고사 <a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1miJYRRXLxX9d23r0SudA1yvqeBO3qeKQ/view?usp=sharing">PDF</a></li>
        <li>하나고등학교 전공탐색의 날 발표자료 <a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1YxI8Qz3pJPKpNJxKAVjpwzv356rnGgwl/view?usp=sharing">PDF</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
